 lia\; all applicants need an ABN and must control the rights to the projec
 t with a clear chain of title. Projects must have budgets of up to AUD 500
 \,000 at the time of applying. WHAT YOU GET: up to AUD 30\,000. APPLICATIO
 N: via SmartyGrants\; the next round opens 14 December 2026 and the fund i
 s scheduled to run as rounds until financial year 2026/27. DEADLINE: 5pm A
