SUMMARY:Deadline: Zoud GameLab 2026: Global Game Jam financial-literacy jam
  (prize and funding pool up to USD 140\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Zoud GameLab is a month-long virtual game jam run by Global Gam
 e Jam and Zoud\, the UAE's national financial wellbeing initiative\, under
  the theme Make FinLit Fun. Participants build a game that integrates fina
 ncial literacy in a meaningful way\; this is part of the judging criteria\
 , and a scoring rubric is published on the jam page. WHO: anyone aged 18 o
 r over by 15 November 2026\, anywhere in the world\; solo developers\, tea
 ms of any size and studios\, each member registering individually. Prior G
 lobal Game Jam participation is not required. WHAT YOU GET: a share of up 
 to USD 140\,000 in prizes and development-support funding\; entrants who w
 ant to be considered for development funding submit the game\, a concept o
 r design document\, a two-minute gameplay video and a game budget. A pre-j
 am learning programme of webinars\, resources and expert sessions ran from
  September. APPLICATION: register and submit on itch.io (and the Global Ga
 me Jam Discord). DEADLINE: 15 November 2026 at 23:59 anywhere on earth (th
 e itch.io counter may show 16 November in some time zones).\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Zoud (UAE National Financial Wellbeing and Sustainability Initiative) w
 ith Global Game Jam\nLocation: Online\, worldwide. Open to participants ag
 ed 18 and over in any country\; solo developers\, teams of any size and st
 udios.\nAward: Shared prize and development-support funding pool of up to 
 USD 140\,000 across best overall game\, runner-up\, third place\, financia
 l-literacy impact\, regional perspective\, compelling gameplay and a Best 
 Game from the UAE award\; individual prize amounts are not published. No e
 ntry fee.\nDuration: Month-long online jam\, 15 October to 15 November 202
 6\; winners announced December 2026.\n\nMore: https://itch.io/jam/zoud-gam
 elab?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://itch.io/jam/zoud-gamelab?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online\, worldwide. Open to participants aged 18 and over in any c
 ountry\; solo developers\, teams of any size and studios.
END:VEVENT
